# Upload only what the terrain API container needs to Cloud Build.
*
!Dockerfile
!analysis/pyproject.toml
!analysis/uv.lock
!analysis/README.md
!analysis/src/**
!api/pyproject.toml
!api/uv.lock
!api/app/**
!data/screening/stage2.v2.json
!data/screening/stage2_stats.v2.json
!data/stack/astgtm_tiles.v3.json
!data/targets/**
**/__pycache__/**
